{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEMO VERSION NOTES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version has only 1 map, 1 game mode (Wave) and 1 gun available.<strong> </strong><br><br><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zombie Demolition: Infinite Zombie Shooter</strong> is a <strong>simple</strong> fps game with roguelite mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing is locked, you get to pick any weapon, map and game mode right off the bat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelite mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you level up, you get to upgrade your weapon base stats (fire rate, damage, etc.) from a random selection and try to survive as long as possible, difficulty increasing the further you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620840/extras/jj.gif?t=1745934606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo or Co-op up to 4 players. LAN or host games through Steam subsystem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ingame chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 different maps, 3 for each game mode and 17 different weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Game modes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free Roam:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roam freely and try to survive as long as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trapped:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped in a corner or an alley and try to survive as long as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wave Mode:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Black Ops zombie mode insipired mode where you fight waves of zombies.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620840?t=1745934606","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620840?t=1745934606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620840/82ace4a12bc364b1482e29b91b1995d299f2e2fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745934606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620840/82ace4a12bc364b1482e29b91b1995d299f2e2fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745934606","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Blood and gun violence."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEMO VERSION NOTES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version has only 1 map, 1 game mode (Wave) and 1 gun available.<strong> </strong><br><br><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zombie Demolition: Infinite Zombie Shooter</strong> is a <strong>simple</strong> fps game with roguelite mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing is locked, you get to pick any weapon, map and game mode right off the bat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelite mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you level up, you get to upgrade your weapon base stats (fire rate, damage, etc.) from a random selection and try to survive as long as possible, difficulty increasing the further you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620840/extras/jj.gif?t=1745934606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo or Co-op up to 4 players. LAN or host games through Steam subsystem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ingame chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 different maps, 3 for each game mode and 17 different weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Game modes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free Roam:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roam freely and try to survive as long as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trapped:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped in a corner or an alley and try to survive as long as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wave Mode:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Black Ops zombie mode insipired mode where you fight waves of zombies.</p></li></ul>","developers":["herbeni"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3599220","name":"Zombie Demolition: Infinite Zombie Shooter"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620840/2f74ae65062be98b6f24f9505b3ef2ba7bfe558a/header.jpg?t=1745934606","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130266,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25